msgctxt "64"
msgid "Takashi! I knew it was you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "You... know him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Oh, yes. Taka here is my grandson... He fell in with the wrong crowd and "
"started shakin' people down for pocket money. Guess it was only a matter of "
"time 'til I was next."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"What were you thinking stealing from your own flesh and blood!? I'll stick "
"you out on your grandfather's boat! That'll adjust your attitude, eh? Now "
"get over here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Granddad's boat? But you know I don't like the ocean!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Thanks for the help, young man. Here's a little somethin' for your trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "You got <Color:8>3,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "I'm sorry, Grandma!  Just please, don't tell Granddad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

